sp.p:
Amen. Whereupon I will show you a chamber with a bed;
    which bed, because it shall not speak of your pretty
    encounters, press it to death: away! And Cupid grant all tongue-tied maidens here Bed, chamber, Pandar to provide this gear! [Exeunt.

sp.l:
[Within] She comes to you.
Enter TROILUS and ULYSSES, at a distance;
after them, THERSITES.
